01:54:58,490 --> 01:55:00,670
Yo, you could technically make a quick route through here.

2251
01:55:02,510 --> 01:55:03,370
Let's do it!

2252
01:55:08,130 --> 01:55:08,770
Yeah.

2253
01:55:12,680 --> 01:55:13,320
Nice.

2254
01:55:17,380 --> 01:55:17,780
Beautiful.

2255
01:55:19,620 --> 01:55:20,420
I don't even care.

2256
01:55:20,520 --> 01:55:21,360
We're gonna go through here.

2257
01:55:21,900 --> 01:55:22,880
Just for the lulz.

2258
01:55:24,660 --> 01:55:26,300
Okay, that explosion is not effective.

2259
01:55:26,880 --> 01:55:28,120
Honestly, it's not gonna...

2260
01:55:28,120 --> 01:55:29,460
I need to go this way, sort of.

2261
01:55:30,500 --> 01:55:31,660
And that's not happening.

2262
01:55:32,000 --> 01:55:34,580
I can't really launch this crystal up there somehow.

2263
01:55:36,780 --> 01:55:38,360
If I find a bomb, I'll do it.

2264
01:55:43,170 --> 01:55:43,970
Okay, we're fine.

2265
01:55:44,190 --> 01:55:45,090
That is flammoxium.

2266
01:55:46,790 --> 01:55:49,070
Sir, would you like some flammoxium on your clothes?

2267
01:55:50,530 --> 01:55:51,790
It's all the rage.

2268
01:55:53,730 --> 01:55:54,170
Oh, you're dead.

2269
01:55:56,110 --> 01:55:56,550
Thank you.

2270
01:55:57,610 --> 01:55:59,990
And his corpse has now been dissolved in acid.

2271
01:56:02,390 --> 01:56:04,130
The standard way of disposing of corpses.

2272
01:56:06,190 --> 01:56:06,690
Flammoxium, sir?

2273
01:56:07,270 --> 01:56:07,810
Care for some?

2274
01:56:18,060 --> 01:56:19,400
What does it do?

2275
01:56:19,980 --> 01:56:20,300
Come on.

2276
01:56:20,680 --> 01:56:21,420
Get flammoxed.

2277
01:56:22,440 --> 01:56:23,540
See, I'm flammoxed now.

2278
01:56:24,680 --> 01:56:25,820
That's not the idea.

2279
01:56:25,820 --> 01:56:26,720
I want him to...

2280
01:56:26,720 --> 01:56:28,260
Oh my god, this is impossible to control.

2281
01:56:30,840 --> 01:56:31,020
Flammox!

2282
01:56:33,780 --> 01:56:34,920
Okay, stop fucking around.

2283
01:56:35,040 --> 01:56:35,660
We're gonna kill him now.

2284
01:56:37,000 --> 01:56:37,980
I do wanna experiment, though.

2285
01:56:41,820 --> 01:56:42,980
Oh, this is catching fire.

2286
01:56:46,930 --> 01:56:47,510
He did.

2287
01:56:55,520 --> 01:56:56,280
Ah, here we are.

2288
01:56:57,480 --> 01:56:58,500
This is the spot.

2289
01:57:00,420 --> 01:57:01,940
I almost got hit by that falling debris.

2290
01:57:06,800 --> 01:57:08,080
So, dude, I'm gonna take this.

2291
01:57:11,180 --> 01:57:12,100
And bring it with me.

2292
01:57:13,580 --> 01:57:15,100
I do not have acceleration, though.

2293
01:57:16,840 --> 01:57:18,040
I actually don't have shit.

2294
01:57:19,280 --> 01:57:20,040
I can't cross.

2295
01:57:22,320 --> 01:57:24,080
I need some of that good stuff first.

2296
01:57:26,080 --> 01:57:27,060
Also called water.

2297
01:57:28,400 --> 01:57:29,480
That would also do the trick.

2298
01:57:33,980 --> 01:57:34,260
Got him.

2299
01:57:35,260 --> 01:57:37,000
At least there's a little delay between their jumps.

2300
01:57:37,380 --> 01:57:39,840
So, if they jump once, you know you're safe for at least a couple seconds.

2301
01:57:41,020 --> 01:57:41,820
Probably one second.

2302
01:57:41,820 --> 01:57:43,740
Let me

2303
01:57:46,930 --> 01:57:47,390
kill you.

2304
01:57:47,730 --> 01:57:49,630
77 gold so far is not terrible.

2305
01:57:51,410 --> 01:57:52,010
It would be better.

2306
01:57:53,770 --> 01:57:54,370
Man, I'm stuck, I'm stuck.

2307
01:58:04,700 --> 01:58:05,440
Not bad.

2308
01:58:10,560 --> 01:58:12,280
I think I... Did I already find some extra health?

2309
01:58:12,540 --> 01:58:13,300
I'm not sure I did.

2310
01:58:13,420 --> 01:58:14,360
Maybe that was last time.

2311
01:58:24,650 --> 01:58:25,450
Uh, Berserkium?

2312
01:58:28,070 --> 01:58:28,150
Douse.

2313
01:58:32,280 --> 01:58:33,120
Shit, that's poison.

2314
01:58:34,320 --> 01:58:35,340
Don't douse yourself in that.

2315
01:58:37,740 --> 01:58:38,860
I keep doing it.

2316
01:58:42,780 --> 01:58:43,960
Berserkium is on me.

2317
01:58:51,290 --> 01:58:51,970
Got him.

2318
01:58:55,590 --> 01:58:55,950
Good.

2319
01:58:57,470 --> 01:58:58,250
Everything's burning here.

2320
01:58:58,530 --> 01:58:59,430
Seems like something exploded.

2321
01:59:04,470 --> 01:59:04,610
Nice.

2322
01:59:09,700 --> 01:59:10,380
My god!

2323
01:59:12,220 --> 01:59:13,660
I could not hit you at all.

2324
01:59:13,860 --> 01:59:15,080
This guy is a Figured Piper Berserkium!

2325
01:59:16,280 --> 01:59:17,360
Oh, there's a bunch of it here.

2326
01:59:17,640 --> 01:59:17,940
That's why.

2327
01:59:20,720 --> 01:59:21,580
And a wand!

2328
01:59:23,120 --> 01:59:24,280
Don't mind if I do.

2329
01:59:29,550 --> 01:59:30,270
Wait a minute, more enemies?

2330
01:59:30,490 --> 01:59:30,570
No.

2331
01:59:31,210 --> 01:59:31,670
What is this?

2332
01:59:32,390 --> 01:59:32,830
Woah!

2333
01:59:33,570 --> 01:59:34,470
Luminous drill with timer.

2334
01:59:35,790 --> 01:59:36,530
Sparkly bounce.

2335
01:59:39,390 --> 01:59:41,430
Uh, there's a bunch of those for some reason.

2336
01:59:41,670 --> 01:59:42,230
Let's try this.

2337
01:59:47,130 --> 01:59:49,390
Oh my god, this is terribly useless.

2338
01:59:52,390 --> 01:59:52,590
Huh?

2339
01:59:55,310 --> 01:59:55,750
Weird.

2340
01:59:56,490 --> 01:59:59,940
Yeah, that's weird.

2341
02:00:02,520 --> 02:00:04,120
But maybe I can use that later.

2342
02:00:04,360 --> 02:00:07,440
There's gotta be a way to really supercharge that...

2343
02:00:08,340 --> 02:00:10,300
drilling spell there to make it somehow insane.

2344
02:00:11,200 --> 02:00:11,980
I would love that.

2345
02:00:13,300 --> 02:00:14,120
What about the Berserkium?

2346
02:00:14,860 --> 02:00:15,360
What is this?

2347
02:00:16,980 --> 02:00:19,620
Cannot pick Kyu- Kyuaskivy.

2348
02:00:20,040 --> 02:00:20,560
Please- Oh!

2349
02:00:23,860 --> 02:00:24,300
Uh...

2350
02:00:24,300 --> 02:00:25,440
I'll get rid of...

2351
02:00:26,350 --> 02:00:27,260
honestly this one.

2352
02:00:32,200 --> 02:00:32,960
What the hell is this?

2353
02:00:34,440 --> 02:00:36,940
This tiny rock looks most fiery.

2354
02:00:38,140 --> 02:00:41,000
But when touched, only a pleasant warmth can be felt.

2355
02:00:42,440 --> 02:00:44,080
Ooh, looks like an egg almost.

2356
02:00:45,080 --> 02:00:45,420
What?

2357
02:00:50,700 --> 02:00:52,620
Oh yeah, it's flamy.

2358
02:00:53,960 --> 02:00:54,940
What if I throw it?

2359
02:00:58,180 --> 02:01:01,240
It is now in the Berserkium.

2360
02:01:03,120 --> 02:01:04,780
Maybe that will do some damage to the enemies.

2361
02:01:05,340 --> 02:01:06,180
If I hit them with it.

2362
02:01:07,340 --> 02:01:08,840
Probably gonna set things aflame, isn't it?

2363
02:01:09,960 --> 02:01:10,280
Dude!

2364
02:01:12,000 --> 02:01:13,480
Maximum health just hanging out there.

2365
02:01:15,260 --> 02:01:15,600
Cool!

2366
02:01:16,620 --> 02:01:17,340
I love that.

2367
02:01:18,660 --> 02:01:19,940
Let's see if we can hit somebody with this.

2368
02:01:20,100 --> 02:01:20,820
What if I throw it hard?

2369
02:01:23,440 --> 02:01:23,840
Nothing?

2370
02:01:26,780 --> 02:01:27,580
Oh, definitely...

2371
02:01:27,580 --> 02:01:28,680
So it's basically a...

2372
02:01:31,240 --> 02:01:31,640
flammable...

2373
02:01:31,640 --> 02:01:34,060
thing that is fine to hold.

2374
02:01:35,180 --> 02:01:36,460
Which is kind of cool, I guess.

2375
02:01:38,260 --> 02:01:39,840
I still haven't found what I need.

2376
02:01:40,020 --> 02:01:41,820
Which is water or some kind of accelerant?

2377
02:01:43,700 --> 02:01:44,740
Or maybe even the...

2378
02:01:44,740 --> 02:01:45,240
Woah!

2379
02:01:47,120 --> 02:01:48,960
Uh oh, yeah, I touched this.

2380
02:01:50,640 --> 02:01:51,940
Maybe don't have it on hand.

2381
02:01:53,660 --> 02:01:54,720
Played a bit safer here.

2382
02:01:57,920 --> 02:01:59,540
Oh no, this is a bad spot for me.

2383
02:02:05,640 --> 02:02:06,540
Can I hit it from here?

2384
02:02:09,140 --> 02:02:09,720
You missed!

2385
02:02:11,980 --> 02:02:13,460
Somehow I took damage just now.

2386
02:02:13,520 --> 02:02:14,080
I don't know how.

2387
02:02:15,720 --> 02:02:16,480
But I did.

2388
02:02:17,620 --> 02:02:18,620
Alright, flaming egg time.

2389
02:02:18,840 --> 02:02:19,200
Here you go, buddies!

2390
02:02:22,180 --> 02:02:22,580
Yeah!

2391
02:02:23,000 --> 02:02:23,720
Set them all aflame.

2392
02:02:23,880 --> 02:02:24,880
Oh, it's not actually doing much.

2393
02:02:28,460 --> 02:02:28,880
Give me that.

2394
02:02:30,220 --> 02:02:30,620
Okay.

2395
02:02:32,980 --> 02:02:34,100
What if I shoot you with this?

2396
02:02:35,500 --> 02:02:36,160
Oh, right.

2397
02:02:36,320 --> 02:02:36,940
That's one of those.

2398
02:02:38,360 --> 02:02:38,560
Whoops!

2399
02:02:42,330 --> 02:02:43,130
Give me that money.

2400
02:02:44,950 --> 02:02:45,710
I see you there.

2401
02:02:47,710 --> 02:02:48,210
Thank you.

2402
02:02:48,750 --> 02:02:49,770
In fact, I'll take this.

2403
02:02:53,300 --> 02:02:54,120
No, the other way, the other way.

2404
02:02:54,800 --> 02:02:56,280
Oh, I have to point that way, of course.

2405
02:02:57,880 --> 02:02:58,760
Never mind, they're dead.

2406
02:03:00,280 --> 02:03:01,220
I'm gonna hit this guy with a missile.

2407
02:03:02,340 --> 02:03:02,960
That's not a missile!

2408
02:03:06,520 --> 02:03:06,660
Burn.

2409
02:03:09,040 --> 02:03:10,100
Oh yeah, he burned it.

2410
02:03:14,960 --> 02:03:15,400
Bye-bye.

2411
02:03:17,520 --> 02:03:19,420
Look at all that sweet gold.

2412
02:03:20,060 --> 02:03:22,240
But, there's a bunch of acid.

2413
02:03:23,160 --> 02:03:24,280
Let's hover it right above it.

2414
02:03:24,640 --> 02:03:25,380
Oh, that was risky.

2415
02:03:25,660 --> 02:03:26,740
I'm on fire now, I'm on fire.

2416
02:03:29,670 --> 02:03:30,130
Fill me.

2417
02:03:30,450 --> 02:03:31,050
Oh no, that's Confusion.

2418
02:03:38,050 --> 02:03:39,070
Oh, I'm an idiot.

2419
02:03:40,210 --> 02:03:43,350
The Confusion completely messed with me in my panic moment.

2420
02:03:43,590 --> 02:03:44,610
I wanted to get in the portal.

2421
02:03:45,550 --> 02:03:48,290
But my character kept running the wrong way.

2422
02:03:49,610 --> 02:03:49,750
Fuck.

2423
02:03:51,570 --> 02:03:52,370
Oh, shit.

2424
02:03:52,610 --> 02:03:56,030
My plan was to go through the portal and jump in the water bath on the other side.

2425
02:03:57,010 --> 02:03:57,970
As quick as I could.

2426
02:03:58,830 --> 02:03:58,950
Shit.

2427
02:04:00,630 --> 02:04:01,350
Man, oh man.

2428
02:04:01,750 --> 02:04:03,070
I will release the worm again.

2429
02:04:03,950 --> 02:04:05,210
Because I need to see something.

2430
02:04:06,270 --> 02:04:08,030
I want to see if it's a different worm every time.

2431
02:04:09,710 --> 02:04:11,750
And maybe if I'm lucky, it'll be a friendly worm.

2432
02:04:12,310 --> 02:04:13,970
I still have hopes for that.

2433
02:04:18,000 --> 02:04:18,840
Boop, boop.

2434
02:04:21,200 --> 02:04:26,660
And then if I find the worm pheromones, I'm going to try and guide it where I want it.

2435
02:04:27,560 --> 02:04:29,760
It's a big if, of course, but could be cool.

2436
02:04:38,370 --> 02:04:38,770
Nice.

2437
02:04:40,010 --> 02:04:40,610
Got it.

2438
02:04:45,250 --> 02:04:45,750
Let's go.

2439
02:04:49,660 --> 02:04:50,240
In fact...

2440
02:04:50,240 --> 02:04:50,840
Oh, dude.

2441
02:04:52,040 --> 02:04:57,020
If I get to the boss, I'm going to release this Kraken right next to the boss and hope it just destroys it.

2442
02:04:58,400 --> 02:04:59,420
Wouldn't that be cool?

2443
02:05:00,220 --> 02:05:00,500
Who knows?

2444
02:05:00,580 --> 02:05:01,940
Maybe it one shots it or something.

2445
02:05:05,250 --> 02:05:06,990
It's sort of RNG the way it moves, right?

2446
02:05:07,130 --> 02:05:12,350
So if I can find a way, a place to hide while that thing does its job, that could be cool.

2447
02:05:15,890 --> 02:05:16,610
What do I have?

2448
02:05:17,190 --> 02:05:20,330
A single spark bolt and unstable crystal again.

2449
02:05:22,070 --> 02:05:23,930
So many times with the unstable crystal.

2450
02:05:26,370 --> 02:05:28,010
We're going to be ultra patient this time.

2451
02:05:31,280 --> 02:05:31,920
Hey, sir.

2452
02:05:34,400 --> 02:05:35,380
You almost hit me there.

2453
02:05:35,820 --> 02:05:36,900
I love the way he's bleeding.

2454
02:05:41,360 --> 02:05:45,420
You know, you make a small hole in him and he bleeds the acid.

2455
02:05:45,540 --> 02:05:46,240
That's so cool.

2456
02:05:48,580 --> 02:05:51,160
Last time there was a minecart here.

2457
02:05:51,180 --> 02:05:53,860
I pushed it in and I couldn't enter because I blocked my own way.

2458
02:05:57,020 --> 02:05:58,400
Give me a beer.

2459
02:05:59,500 --> 02:06:00,780
What if I just destroyed completely?

2460
02:06:03,810 --> 02:06:06,170
Wow, this thing is doing a great job holding in the liquid.

2461
02:06:08,170 --> 02:06:10,250
Right now it's, I believe, water.

2462
02:06:12,670 --> 02:06:14,290
Um, I'm drunk AF.

2463
02:06:15,890 --> 02:06:16,850
I don't think that's good.

2464
02:06:16,970 --> 02:06:18,470
That's like a negative status effect.

2465
02:06:21,460 --> 02:06:22,600
Not a positive one.

2466
02:06:24,360 --> 02:06:25,520
The outside is right there.

2467
02:06:32,940 --> 02:06:34,440
Motherfucker, you hit me.

2468
02:06:37,200 --> 02:06:44,340
I could probably launch that there and give it the old attack.

2469
02:06:48,120 --> 02:06:49,180
Hello, it's working.

2470
02:06:53,330 --> 02:06:54,810
The whole tree fell down.

2471
02:06:58,020 --> 02:06:59,340
Hey, I made it.

2472
02:06:59,800 --> 02:07:00,260
Look at this.

2473
02:07:00,420 --> 02:07:01,540
I escaped the mines.

2474
02:07:02,820 --> 02:07:06,900
Let's explore this way a bit because I believe there is an upgrade you can get over here.

2475
02:07:07,220 --> 02:07:08,100
And then I'll come back.

2476
02:07:08,740 --> 02:07:10,690
There's a floating piece of dirt.

2477
02:07:11,540 --> 02:07:11,900
There.

2478
02:07:12,560 --> 02:07:13,120
And you know what?

2479
02:07:13,120 --> 02:07:13,800
Let me go on top of that.

2480
02:07:14,340 --> 02:07:15,040
That seems interesting.

2481
02:07:21,270 --> 02:07:21,750
It's nothing.

2482
02:07:23,970 --> 02:07:24,450
Well, okay.

2483
02:07:25,370 --> 02:07:26,030
Not bad.

2484
02:07:29,410 --> 02:07:29,990
What is here?

2485
02:07:31,650 --> 02:07:32,470
It's the ocean.

2486
02:07:34,030 --> 02:07:35,690
Um, dude, it's actually night now.

2487
02:07:36,190 --> 02:07:36,950
How cool is that?

2488
02:07:37,870 --> 02:07:40,550
I kind of want to have a torch or something now.

2489
02:07:40,650 --> 02:07:41,150
That would be cool.

2490
02:07:41,630 --> 02:07:42,790
Is this thing still down here?

2491
02:07:43,930 --> 02:07:44,510
It is.

2492
02:07:44,650 --> 02:07:45,770
What the hell is that?

2493
02:07:47,190 --> 02:07:48,410
That is so mysterious.

2494
02:07:51,670 --> 02:07:53,410
Doesn't that look like some kind of musical instrument?

2495
02:07:54,390 --> 02:07:55,330
I'm going to try and destroy it again.

2496
02:07:56,750 --> 02:07:58,470
All my projectiles are being slowed by the water.

2497
02:08:02,020 --> 02:08:02,800
It made a sound.

2498
02:08:05,960 --> 02:08:06,940
You hear it?

2499
02:08:12,590 --> 02:08:12,970
Wait a minute.

2500
02:08:15,230 --> 02:08:16,610
Last time it exploded, I think.

2501
02:08:17,350 --> 02:08:18,050
If I remember correctly.

2502
02:08:22,230 --> 02:08:23,590
Oh man, it's taking all the damage here.

2503
02:08:27,700 --> 02:08:29,460
I'm cutting pieces of it.

2504
02:08:33,080 --> 02:08:38,320
I mean, the fact that it's taking damage, damage numbers, means it's going to...

2505
02:08:38,320 --> 02:08:41,180
There was another big boom in the distance.

2506
02:08:42,800 --> 02:08:43,720
Like a rumble.

2507
02:08:47,460 --> 02:08:47,740
Okay.

2508
02:08:49,460 --> 02:08:50,460
Why is this not happening?

2509
02:08:51,020 --> 02:08:51,260
Wait a minute.

2510
02:08:54,800 --> 02:08:55,240
Wow!

2511
02:08:55,640 --> 02:08:56,540
Okay, so that...

2512
02:08:56,540 --> 02:08:57,740
Is that an enemy then?

2513
02:08:57,800 --> 02:09:00,020
That counts as an entity of sorts.

2514
02:09:02,540 --> 02:09:03,200
Or not.

2515
02:09:10,840 --> 02:09:12,440
I don't know what's going on there.

2516
02:09:13,680 --> 02:09:15,120
It's a mystery to be sure.

2517
02:09:17,760 --> 02:09:19,080
Let's see what's over here again.

2518
02:09:21,600 --> 02:09:24,080
I think there is an orb somewhere.

2519
02:09:25,300 --> 02:09:30,380
And the good thing is, we can get back to the mines really quickly because of that little path that I carved.

2520
02:09:32,620 --> 02:09:33,000
What is this?

2521
02:09:33,780 --> 02:09:33,920
