02:23:34,600 --> 02:23:37,760
There's a wand, embedded in the rock.

2797
02:23:39,880 --> 02:23:40,820
Look at that.

2798
02:23:42,560 --> 02:23:43,800
I can't get to that.

2799
02:23:44,780 --> 02:23:45,900
I don't have the means.

2800
02:23:47,700 --> 02:23:48,540
I have this.

2801
02:23:49,200 --> 02:23:49,360
Boom!

2802
02:23:50,120 --> 02:23:51,420
Why did that explode so quick?

2803
02:23:52,400 --> 02:23:53,080
Alright, I'm gonna leave.

2804
02:23:53,920 --> 02:23:54,720
This is too dangerous.

2805
02:23:55,400 --> 02:23:56,360
I have deemed it so.

2806
02:23:57,660 --> 02:23:58,820
We have to follow protocol.

2807
02:23:59,820 --> 02:24:00,440
And protocol is...

2808
02:24:03,080 --> 02:24:03,520
Uh...

2809
02:24:03,520 --> 02:24:04,700
Play it safe, play it slow.

2810
02:24:07,480 --> 02:24:08,340
And never take risks.

2811
02:24:08,620 --> 02:24:08,860
What's this?

2812
02:24:09,260 --> 02:24:10,200
Magic missile, lovely.

2813
02:24:12,020 --> 02:24:12,880
I like that.

2814
02:24:12,940 --> 02:24:15,500
That means I can actually go back here and get to that wand.

2815
02:24:16,660 --> 02:24:17,200
Hello!

2816
02:24:18,020 --> 02:24:20,140
Imagine if that wand contains something insane now.

2817
02:24:21,180 --> 02:24:22,880
That would be the story of a lifetime.

2818
02:24:24,040 --> 02:24:24,180
Ew.

2819
02:24:28,790 --> 02:24:29,330
Um...

2820
02:24:29,330 --> 02:24:30,450
Let's not get stand to...

2821
02:24:30,450 --> 02:24:32,350
Oh actually, it's sort of burning nicely here.

2822
02:24:33,770 --> 02:24:34,770
I do like the burning.

2823
02:24:37,530 --> 02:24:39,370
But I'm gonna stand here safe distance.

2824
02:24:40,770 --> 02:24:40,910
Scrap!

2825
02:24:41,690 --> 02:24:42,330
I missed.

2826
02:24:43,730 --> 02:24:43,990
Shit.

2827
02:24:45,490 --> 02:24:45,990
Got it.

2828
02:24:46,750 --> 02:24:48,750
Okay, so I can stand a little bit closer, I think.

2829
02:24:50,130 --> 02:24:50,930
There we go.

2830
02:24:52,270 --> 02:24:53,270
Yes, dig it out.

2831
02:24:54,610 --> 02:24:55,350
There it is!

2832
02:24:58,980 --> 02:24:59,460
Okay.

2833
02:25:00,160 --> 02:25:01,120
The all-seeing eye.

2834
02:25:02,100 --> 02:25:02,480
Utility.

2835
02:25:03,640 --> 02:25:05,060
So that's a type in itself.

2836
02:25:05,940 --> 02:25:06,960
It's not passive.

2837
02:25:08,900 --> 02:25:09,800
It's a utility.

2838
02:25:10,240 --> 02:25:10,740
Wait, damage?

2839
02:25:11,100 --> 02:25:11,200
Drill?

2840
02:25:11,700 --> 02:25:12,440
Why is that a stat?

2841
02:25:13,400 --> 02:25:14,280
What does that even mean?

2842
02:25:16,860 --> 02:25:19,000
This one has a very short cast delay.

2843
02:25:21,240 --> 02:25:22,180
Is this wand good though?

2844
02:25:23,260 --> 02:25:24,140
250 max max?

2845
02:25:24,160 --> 02:25:25,700
I don't even think this is that good.

2846
02:25:27,780 --> 02:25:30,940
I'm gonna keep this because this has insane stats here, doesn't it?

2847
02:25:32,200 --> 02:25:34,700
Then again, this one does too, but it only has one slot.

2848
02:25:36,400 --> 02:25:37,280
And it shuffles.

2849
02:25:37,900 --> 02:25:39,280
But that's okay, if I can put...

2850
02:25:40,540 --> 02:25:42,560
...spitter bolt in here, that would be really nice as well.

2851
02:25:43,600 --> 02:25:44,560
I'm gonna leave it.

2852
02:25:45,020 --> 02:25:45,780
I don't want it.

2853
02:25:46,320 --> 02:25:46,740
I refuse.

2854
02:25:47,680 --> 02:25:50,580
But now we have peace of mind knowing that there was nothing insane in that wand.

2855
02:25:51,980 --> 02:25:52,820
And that makes me happy.

2856
02:25:54,800 --> 02:25:56,200
Do need to collect some more water though.

2857
02:25:56,880 --> 02:26:00,560
You know, blood is just the same as water, except with a bit more...

2858
02:26:02,340 --> 02:26:03,080
...kick, you know?

2859
02:26:05,180 --> 02:26:06,180
Just grab all this.

2860
02:26:09,240 --> 02:26:10,140
Wait, why am I taking damage?

2861
02:26:12,560 --> 02:26:13,680
You can still fit...

2862
02:26:13,680 --> 02:26:14,740
What is... hold on.

2863
02:26:15,880 --> 02:26:16,780
Satiated 31%.

2864
02:26:17,400 --> 02:26:19,180
I do wonder what that even means.

2865
02:26:22,620 --> 02:26:24,260
Your stomach is almost empty.

2866
02:26:26,460 --> 02:26:28,360
What is the point of that?

2867
02:26:31,220 --> 02:26:33,080
Bloody clo... you sense an incre...

2868
02:26:33,080 --> 02:26:35,140
Oh, this is actually just...

2869
02:26:35,140 --> 02:26:39,280
Okay, so blood is actually just better water all around.

2870
02:26:39,860 --> 02:26:41,260
I kind of forgot I read about that.

2871
02:26:42,100 --> 02:26:43,720
Increased chance of critical hits?

2872
02:26:44,640 --> 02:26:45,220
Hell yeah!

2873
02:26:48,180 --> 02:26:48,580
Blood me up!

2874
02:26:52,240 --> 02:26:53,940
Not that I need to crit against these guys.

2875
02:26:55,080 --> 02:26:56,080
These are just critters.

2876
02:26:57,440 --> 02:26:58,320
And I'm a critter.

2877
02:26:59,260 --> 02:27:00,460
But a different kind of critter.

2878
02:27:02,800 --> 02:27:02,980
Blip!

2879
02:27:05,040 --> 02:27:06,660
Alright, we've been doing well so far.

2880
02:27:07,940 --> 02:27:08,860
Let me grab that gold.

2881
02:27:09,520 --> 02:27:10,560
166 gold, that's nice.

2882
02:27:10,820 --> 02:27:11,780
We're doing really well.

2883
02:27:15,850 --> 02:27:16,690
Let's keep exploring.

2884
02:27:17,810 --> 02:27:18,250
Yapsie!

2885
02:27:23,900 --> 02:27:24,260
Good.

2886
02:27:26,820 --> 02:27:27,260
Nice.

2887
02:27:28,000 --> 02:27:28,840
And there's a dude up here.

2888
02:27:29,020 --> 02:27:29,700
Let me take care of him.

2889
02:27:32,240 --> 02:27:33,360
Needs a stern talking to.

2890
02:27:34,920 --> 02:27:35,600
There we go.

2891
02:27:36,260 --> 02:27:36,720
How about you?

2892
02:27:37,600 --> 02:27:38,380
You up for debate?

2893
02:27:40,220 --> 02:27:40,300
Oi!

2894
02:27:41,380 --> 02:27:41,780
Sick.

2895
02:27:42,960 --> 02:27:43,960
Why is everything burning there?

2896
02:27:47,010 --> 02:27:48,450
I should stop asking these questions.

2897
02:27:49,730 --> 02:27:50,970
Everything just burns in this game.

2898
02:27:51,310 --> 02:27:52,030
Everything explodes.

2899
02:27:53,170 --> 02:27:53,430
Violence everywhere.

2900
02:27:54,830 --> 02:27:55,410
Look at that!

2901
02:27:55,870 --> 02:27:56,790
I killed the guy.

2902
02:27:57,470 --> 02:27:59,790
He slid off this plate here.

2903
02:28:00,470 --> 02:28:04,010
And collided with a lamp that fell and caused a huge fire now.

2904
02:28:05,810 --> 02:28:07,530
This is the sort of shit I live for.

2905
02:28:07,790 --> 02:28:08,450
I love it.

2906
02:28:09,610 --> 02:28:10,730
Oh, I'm stuck here now.

2907
02:28:11,450 --> 02:28:12,130
You know what that means.

2908
02:28:13,350 --> 02:28:14,230
It's diamond time!

2909
02:28:15,770 --> 02:28:15,850
Blip!

2910
02:28:17,930 --> 02:28:19,090
Blow that shit up.

2911
02:28:21,650 --> 02:28:23,430
We do that again, because that was fun.

2912
02:28:27,050 --> 02:28:27,370
Hell yeah.

2913
02:28:28,170 --> 02:28:28,750
Carving a path.

2914
02:28:30,130 --> 02:28:30,750
And there's an enemy.

2915
02:28:30,910 --> 02:28:31,990
He's gonna catch fire now.

2916
02:28:33,410 --> 02:28:34,490
Let's just wait for him to die.

2917
02:28:34,830 --> 02:28:36,870
In fact, I can go here and be relatively safe.

2918
02:28:37,890 --> 02:28:39,030
In fact, I'll fill up my water bottle.

2919
02:28:40,910 --> 02:28:41,350
There we go.

2920
02:28:42,490 --> 02:28:43,210
And the guy died.

2921
02:28:44,390 --> 02:28:46,030
And all these beams are burning.

2922
02:28:47,010 --> 02:28:47,610
There's a chest!

2923
02:28:49,430 --> 02:28:50,030
Fuck yeah!

2924
02:28:53,180 --> 02:28:54,640
I'm not risking that gold.

2925
02:28:55,420 --> 02:28:56,320
Let's just wait for this to burn.

2926
02:28:57,040 --> 02:28:58,360
In fact, I could piss on it a little bit.

2927
02:29:01,910 --> 02:29:02,870
Yeah, don't burn the chest!

2928
02:29:07,570 --> 02:29:08,410
I need more water.

2929
02:29:09,230 --> 02:29:10,010
Oh, wait.

2930
02:29:11,030 --> 02:29:11,050
Huh?

2931
02:29:16,830 --> 02:29:17,270
Uh...

2932
02:29:17,910 --> 02:29:18,350
Ukuskivi.

2933
02:29:22,940 --> 02:29:23,740
What the hell is that?

2934
02:29:25,100 --> 02:29:27,900
This small rock makes you feel very charged.

2935
02:29:29,460 --> 02:29:29,900
Okay!

2936
02:29:32,380 --> 02:29:32,860
Interesting!

2937
02:29:34,340 --> 02:29:35,220
So I can...

2938
02:29:37,140 --> 02:29:38,040
electrify things.

2939
02:29:39,520 --> 02:29:41,540
Let me grab it again in between charges.

2940
02:29:43,520 --> 02:29:43,660
Yuck!

2941
02:29:43,940 --> 02:29:44,380
There we go.

2942
02:29:45,440 --> 02:29:46,880
I'm gonna take that with me.

2943
02:29:47,600 --> 02:29:48,780
That is very interesting.

2944
02:29:49,980 --> 02:29:51,260
I wonder how I can utilize that.

2945
02:29:53,840 --> 02:29:56,700
I did find another rock that...

2946
02:29:56,700 --> 02:29:58,280
did something when I kicked it, remember?

2947
02:30:02,700 --> 02:30:04,960
I think this is in the same vein as that.

2948
02:30:10,920 --> 02:30:11,360
Okay.

2949
02:30:12,920 --> 02:30:13,860
Why do I hear moaning?

2950
02:30:16,140 --> 02:30:19,100
It's not as intense as in that other place, but it's there.

2951
02:30:19,660 --> 02:30:20,400
And I hear it.

2952
02:30:21,660 --> 02:30:22,620
I've seen everything.

2953
02:30:24,580 --> 02:30:25,080
There's gold!

2954
02:30:28,170 --> 02:30:29,270
Oh, it's gone, it's gone.

2955
02:30:30,030 --> 02:30:33,870
Uh, gold here, I'll take that.

2956
02:30:36,190 --> 02:30:37,930
And we've got a bottle!

2957
02:30:40,730 --> 02:30:41,930
A worm pheromone!

2958
02:30:43,190 --> 02:30:45,870
Okay, I have to go back and grab the worm now.

2959
02:30:46,510 --> 02:30:48,690
We have to try this experiment now.

2960
02:30:50,650 --> 02:30:51,130
Also...

2961
02:30:51,130 --> 02:30:52,390
Oh, that's just one of those enemies.

2962
02:30:53,190 --> 02:30:54,030
That looked a little scary.

2963
02:30:55,650 --> 02:30:58,750
It's really nice that these small ones also drop ten gold every time.

2964
02:31:02,960 --> 02:31:03,920
Oh, that's...

2965
02:31:05,770 --> 02:31:07,870
I gotta go out and grab that worm.

2966
02:31:08,670 --> 02:31:10,510
It needs to happen immediately.

2967
02:31:14,870 --> 02:31:15,790
Go here...

2968
02:31:15,790 --> 02:31:16,370
What do we have up here?

2969
02:31:18,090 --> 02:31:19,150
Uh, not much.

2970
02:31:20,610 --> 02:31:21,530
Back to the entrance.

2971
02:31:22,010 --> 02:31:22,850
And that is right here.

2972
02:31:26,460 --> 02:31:29,740
This is one of the few times when you can actually go back to the start.

2973
02:31:30,720 --> 02:31:31,220
I wonder...

2974
02:31:31,220 --> 02:31:32,640
When I'm here...

2975
02:31:32,640 --> 02:31:33,370
Oh, I cannot...

2976
02:31:34,720 --> 02:31:35,420
change my wants.

2977
02:31:36,880 --> 02:31:38,430
I think it needs to be in that...

2978
02:31:39,620 --> 02:31:39,840
place.

2979
02:31:41,440 --> 02:31:42,380
The Holy Mountain.

2980
02:31:45,150 --> 02:31:45,670
Okay.

2981
02:31:46,870 --> 02:31:47,830
And now it's night.

2982
02:31:48,490 --> 02:31:51,270
We spent a nice day in there doing important things.

2983
02:31:54,840 --> 02:31:57,100
I wanna try and mix chemicals...

2984
02:31:57,100 --> 02:31:57,740
with powders.

2985
02:31:58,900 --> 02:31:59,680
Something just exploded.

2986
02:32:00,900 --> 02:32:02,120
They're still having fun in the mines.

2987
02:32:03,940 --> 02:32:05,700
This is what happens when you play patiently.

2988
02:32:06,900 --> 02:32:07,900
Almost max HP.

2989
02:32:09,580 --> 02:32:10,600
Everything's going great.

2990
02:32:12,580 --> 02:32:13,500
It's a lot of fun.

2991
02:32:17,610 --> 02:32:18,110
Yuck.

2992
02:32:19,490 --> 02:32:20,330
I have an idea.

2993
02:32:22,590 --> 02:32:23,650
Let's just try this.

2994
02:32:29,250 --> 02:32:30,150
It's blue, right?

2995
02:32:30,290 --> 02:32:31,070
Just like this altar.

2996
02:32:31,630 --> 02:32:33,090
Will it reward my curiosity?

2997
02:32:37,960 --> 02:32:38,380
Come on.

2998
02:32:39,020 --> 02:32:40,600
What if I piss on your altar?

2999
02:32:44,940 --> 02:32:46,440
Oh, it's catching electricity now.

3000
02:32:46,540 --> 02:32:46,840
That's dangerous.

3001
02:32:48,340 --> 02:32:48,640
Rabbit.

3002
02:32:49,640 --> 02:32:51,720
I will not pick that thing up.

3003
02:32:54,040 --> 02:32:55,160
No, no, no, no, no.

3004
02:32:56,340 --> 02:32:58,020
Oh, I love this soundtrack here.

3005
02:33:01,140 --> 02:33:04,480
It's like, fills me with dread, but it's also mysterious.

3006
02:33:05,260 --> 02:33:06,460
Makes me want to explore more.

3007
02:33:09,630 --> 02:33:10,450
That's the best.

3008
02:33:11,370 --> 02:33:12,270
267 gold.

3009
02:33:13,110 --> 02:33:13,710
That's solid.

3010
02:33:15,170 --> 02:33:18,130
We could purchase some good stuff with that when we get to the Holy Mountain.

3011
02:33:20,210 --> 02:33:21,370
The Holy Mountain.

3012
02:33:25,360 --> 02:33:28,080
Doesn't it kind of look like the wheel of this wheelbarrow is a face?

3013
02:33:29,020 --> 02:33:29,860
Mouth, eyes.

3014
02:33:31,000 --> 02:33:32,080
A smiley face.

3015
02:33:33,400 --> 02:33:33,780
Fuck you.

3016
02:33:34,720 --> 02:33:35,800
Oh, doesn't even work.

3017
02:33:35,940 --> 02:33:36,900
I have to kick it from this side.

3018
02:33:40,020 --> 02:33:41,300
Six skateboarding tricks.

3019
02:33:43,820 --> 02:33:44,760
Okay, so watch this.

3020
02:33:45,400 --> 02:33:47,840
I shall release the worm, but you know what?

3021
02:33:47,900 --> 02:33:48,480
I'm going to wait a bit.

3022
02:33:48,940 --> 02:33:50,780
Because I'm going to get to the portal first.

3023
02:33:51,000 --> 02:33:53,860
Just to have an exit if shit goes wrong, okay?

3024
02:33:54,440 --> 02:34:01,780
If I'm about to release the mother of all worms, I want to be able to go through that portal ASAP.

3025
02:34:02,380 --> 02:34:03,400
So that's the plan.

3026
02:34:04,000 --> 02:34:05,040
Kill that guy.

3027
02:34:07,640 --> 02:34:08,640
What's over here?

3028
02:34:08,960 --> 02:34:10,060
I need to explore everything.

3029
02:34:11,920 --> 02:34:12,280
There's nothing.

3030
02:34:13,300 --> 02:34:13,540
Water bottle.

3031
02:34:16,080 --> 02:34:17,540
Fill me up.

3032
02:34:18,760 --> 02:34:20,800
Fill up my belly with water.

3033
02:34:24,120 --> 02:34:26,320
And we got that shit.

3034
02:34:27,420 --> 02:34:28,840
Some uranium waste.

3035
02:34:30,280 --> 02:34:31,000
Oh my god.

3036
02:34:32,200 --> 02:34:33,400
We're about to have a party here.

3037
02:34:33,840 --> 02:34:33,920
Watch.

3038
02:34:35,940 --> 02:34:36,100
Hey.

3039
02:34:36,620 --> 02:34:37,000
Hey dude.

3040
02:34:40,080 --> 02:34:40,920
Fuck me.

3041
02:34:41,680 --> 02:34:42,040
Oh!

3042
02:34:42,840 --> 02:34:44,200
I did not expect there to be an enemy.

3043
02:34:45,020 --> 02:34:45,800
But there's a bunch of gold.

3044
02:34:45,920 --> 02:34:46,300
I'll take it.

3045
02:34:48,080 --> 02:34:52,920
I'm not going to take that gold nogget, because I am patient and I am risk averse.

3046
02:34:54,980 --> 02:34:56,100
I shall take no risks.

3047
02:34:58,100 --> 02:34:59,200
Except I just sort of did.

3048
02:35:00,300 --> 02:35:01,220
But that was a fun risk.

3049
02:35:01,680 --> 02:35:02,140
That's different.

3050
02:35:05,380 --> 02:35:06,540
Why is there a piece of wood here?

3051
02:35:06,600 --> 02:35:07,100
That's mysterious.

3052
02:35:09,940 --> 02:35:10,680
I don't like that.

3053
02:35:11,860 --> 02:35:13,120
I do like the water here though.

3054
02:35:14,580 --> 02:35:14,800
Oh!

3055
02:35:14,940 --> 02:35:16,540
That was the collapsed mines?

3056
02:35:17,160 --> 02:35:17,900
That little area.

3057
02:35:20,120 --> 02:35:21,100
Now I have to get in there.

3058
02:35:23,640 --> 02:35:24,880
That's four... I can make a path.

3059
02:35:26,720 --> 02:35:27,280
Whoa!

3060
02:35:27,580 --> 02:35:27,920
Hello.

3061
02:35:30,000 --> 02:35:30,800
Ah, you did.

3062
02:35:32,260 --> 02:35:33,180
Love this one.

3063
02:35:33,440 --> 02:35:33,780
You know what?

3064
02:35:34,140 --> 02:35:36,040
This spell right here is actually insane.

3065
02:35:42,040 --> 02:35:45,060
What is the difference between the normal mines and this part?

3066
02:35:46,260 --> 02:35:47,660
I don't think I've noticed that yet.

3067
02:35:48,380 --> 02:35:48,600
Really.

3068
02:35:50,220 --> 02:35:51,340
That's a...

3069
02:35:51,340 --> 02:35:52,160
That's a...

3070
02:35:52,160 --> 02:35:52,600
What's happening?

3071
02:35:54,860 --> 02:35:55,940
Who is throwing bombs?

3072
02:36:03,580 --> 02:36:04,800
We've got moaning again?

